  </item>
  <item>
    <title>爵了... 聊到天亮</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bba08233591c27bedf58e1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bba08233591c27bedf58e1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Aug 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>带上笑容 &nbsp;带上祝愿 &nbsp;领着孩子 &nbsp;常 ......</span></p><p><span>(搞错了，重写）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp6dyGjbcQYURAoQCdwjPe6aP1gL.JPG"></figure><p><span>带着立陶宛Uptown Rhythm的荣耀</span></p><p><span>带着一个月后即将举办的</span><strong><span>爵了姐妹</span></strong></p><p><span>领着......奖状与海报</span></p><p><span>铁锤过着江河常回家看看</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhjEjWh1CYypK_HY_b4raaZNli0e.PNG"></figure><p><span>我们跳完舞 喝完酒 深夜开录</span></p><p><span>从立陶宛聊到布鲁塞尔</span></p><p><span>从 Savoy 聊到 La Jam</span></p><p><span>从对老爵的探索聊到与自己身体的和解 &nbsp;等等</span></p><p><span>从午夜聊到天亮</span></p><p><span>这一夜</span></p><p><span>真的很 &nbsp;Chill</span></p><p><span>这一晚</span></p><p><span>真的很 &nbsp;JAZZ</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FriXf0tPGChVmo_tRV6-WxDvJLvu.jpg"></figure><p><span>（铁锤 ｜江河｜穆沐｜柴夫｜车车｜西游｜十一 ）</span></p><p><span>接下来，欢迎大家来听我们聊天：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 立陶宛之体会（包括如何在东欧人中被看到？对比赛场地、乐队、赛制、竞赛失误的心得等）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2987">49:47</a> 五星推荐 布鲁塞尔Burning swing 活动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3610">60:10</a> La Jam 到底拉在哪里？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3997">66:37</a> 摇摆舞到底是复古还是往前走 ？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5775">96:15</a> 全职舞者的感悟与方向</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6450">107:30</a> 爵了姐妹概况</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhufnEMIUmANgqxl0p1k7qVb_ZX7.JPG"></figure><p><span>👈：立陶宛Uptown Rhythm 2024 Adv &nbsp;Mix&amp;Match 随机搭档赛高级组 季军</span></p><p><span>🀄️：立陶宛Uptown Rhythm 2024 Strictly固定搭档赛 冠军</span></p><p><span>👉：立陶宛Uptown Rhythm 2024 Open Mix&amp;Match 随机搭档赛公开组 冠军</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoAC7tMsW7NHVL1el_IkcSyAhVa5.JPG"></figure><p><span>👈宣布获得冠军时的惊喜瞬间&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>👉固搭决赛时的意外青蛙跳 or 猴子跳</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjBRbFsn7vtTysdFb8uwrxq9p7OP.jpg"></figure><p><span>👆江河可能具体是指恒河</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv2zbVyVw9wfWnch6iFK_mLZReSm.jpg"></figure><p><span>👆河哥的舞蹈动作是“信手拈来”，他的比喻是“映入眼帘”。请注意前方🚴</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv7bbZtVsaHy08CR26Nb9Gvnx3bK.JPG"></figure><p><span>👆Savoy cup 2024 表演中的戏剧张力。锤姐：求求你...别演了</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgHz8kLbZV58ruwfH3RyCHAxQ83I.JPG"></figure><p><span>👆Savoy cup 2024 吸睛要属新中式......当然还有大长腿👇</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpDkP89ruq4Or_JNcqCCE7Hoik4r.JPG"></figure><p><strong><span>玩归玩 &nbsp;闹归闹 &nbsp;不能忘了做广告！！！</span></strong></p><p><span>广告｜爵了姐妹</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuPsB00T4WcRXpAMKxNW5oZsDvnE.JPG"></figure><p><span>课程安排👇</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhnRmu4yhpsu_kk_KFIilO9f_tmy.JPG"></figure><p><span>冲！姐妹们！爵了！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlRX9pLDuuAfMsovrKHjyJgVpiX3.JPG"></figure><p><span>鸣谢节目场地｜杭州摇摆温柔乡</span></p><p><span>本期 🔍 JAZZ</span></p><p><span>片头｜Stars Fell On Alabama</span></p><p><span>片尾｜I Feel Fine</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh27ot6aR75sVzlszSbl31SLRqJk.m4a" length="107595934" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:50:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FplaYMRafra6HSljcPAaPF3NOAil.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>爵对莱斯 超级返场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6679b3a5d3fc5dd627c20cd4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6679b3a5d3fc5dd627c20cd4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Jun 2024 17:57:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>让我们再“爵”一次！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgYmLomnzc7S1UO2qaXfVSYMKgxD.JPG"></figure><p><span>内容有点长，我帮大家靴微缕一缕</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 传闻“卖房卖车办活动”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="524">08:44</a> 梦回爵对莱斯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2191">36:31</a> STAFF </span><strong><span>大蒜糖</span></strong><span> on line&nbsp;</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3662">61:02</a> STAFF </span><strong><span>啊汤</span></strong><span> on line</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4003">66:43</a> STAFF </span><strong><span>鲁大师</span></strong><span> on line</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4570">76:10</a> STAFF </span><strong><span>JIAYIN</span></strong><span> on line</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5548">92:28</a> 下一场的梦如何造？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6055">100:55</a> 抽奖“西湖摇摆嘉年华2024 party pass”</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJtaOrRqaY4uPS0ll2f3HvlRea8.JPG"></figure><p><span>主播：@61 @含英 @柴夫 @穆沐 @十一</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnOxxS_O1K7qpaG5qpLnOrh8MkLs.JPG"></figure><p><span>爵对莱斯2024现场</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjFkLrZqQ5wxwXueaeBh9tTvU-V.JPG"></figure><p><span>&nbsp;Swing Shouters 乐队融入舞者互动，嗨翻了</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhGHFQH8nyn5Ei7KmDQN7CGTCwT0.JPG"></figure><p><span>@61 @含英 与乐队的即兴碰撞，@61说：“这是个意外”</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqL9qQx30khmy1Qc0p5h85HNHwKX.JPG"></figure><p><span>即使不跳舞，都是一场超级棒的 live hose现场</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FinJyczCMUelWmPpLYvqlIlvsyjP.JPG"></figure><p><span>明星导师 Ryan与Sing共舞，乐队即兴演奏了Shiny Stockings，全场舞者合唱</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FttCJJvq1ASnl5sHs7KY_YbDTzAR.JPG"></figure><p><span>《绷不住了啦》</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FowAvUZHqULkWIFN4YGXcWfIQu_L.JPG"></figure><p><span>绷不住的何止一个呢？有一个算一个，你是吗？</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOoiM8qJCZtVyunyiPfnYzUPb-Q.JPG"></figure><p><span>国内大型活动首次尝试秋月赛现场，这是我最爱的一张</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuQC8lK2O81pM_5zguK1Bh3Ft387.JPG"></figure><p><span>还有这张，跳到爽，爽到累，借你的shouder歇一歇，再继续...</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmLbOtRoc77lf1H13GkrjjEDzWUt.JPG"></figure><p><span>“诗歌当铺”的意外惊喜，那时的你有没有驻足抬头看，你有没有被感动到？</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmarc4iDKDluwIv7TSlQT1j9uAV1.JPG"></figure><p><span>爵对莱斯2024就像一场梦</span></p><p><span>结束的时候很多人都哭了</span></p><p><span>也许是因为梦要醒了...</span></p><p><span>但对于爵对莱斯来说不是一个结束</span></p><p><span>而是新的开始 &nbsp;继续造梦的开始</span></p><p><span>无需担心下一场</span></p><p><span>包括下一场的城市杭州 &nbsp;“西湖摇摆嘉年华2024”</span></p><p><strong><span>你来就是最好的 &nbsp;因为有你</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fge5-mqIL8Z32Mfiy1T9wkDAk1oM.JPG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv3osu3Ev6YayHLUydaSihIYSOfl.JPG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvAkWGS__7U08W05AVy_KeYOePjQ.JPG"></figure><p><span>不知道这样的广告植入会不会有点硬？</span></p><p><span>反正我尽力了。</span></p><p><span>本期 ｜ JAZZ</span></p><p><span>片头 ｜ 《Tailor Made》Swing Shouters</span></p><p><span>片尾 ｜ 《Shiny Stockings》Swing Shouters 于爵对莱斯2024现场演奏</span></p><p><span>鸣谢场地支持 ｜ 杭州认真摇摆 INTAGO舞房</span></p><p><span>摄影提供 ｜ 杭州舞者 @西游</span></p><p><span>录音设备提供 ｜ 播客《三个火呛手》</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhvNvT8WdeNuL9g6IlRUzGIturSA.m4a" length="101023632" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:44:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuNqDo5sXOs_3n0E2vE3_ff4pA-e.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>“沐” 强 “柴” 会赢</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664b29df251bd96e6c8efbfb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664b29df251bd96e6c8efbfb</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 May 2024 10:45:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>520遇上了小满</span></p><span></span><p><span>前者是舞者对摇摆舞的深情告白</span></p><span></span><p><span>后者是舞者在SAVOY中的成绩单</span></p><span></span><p><span>国际沐与国际柴</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然还有我们每一个人</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论是成绩还是所处阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span>皆为 小满</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnI0HlOg9ddZzSa74oe1vMbST5Gi.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（穆沐与柴夫于 savoy cup 2024 中唯一拿得出手的合影）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpnWa9l9WADCcjdG1YtrT-y8uFo-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（本期录制现场）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgY4LD8-mdV_v8qUNL3OGW1at_mG.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（savoy cup 2024 City Battle 上海team淘汰意大利米兰队，成功杀入半决赛，最终获得此赛别 亚军）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>@小Ming：人就是活那么几个瞬间吧！</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuvWpNuYI-YLgmgVcrI-Fi_Fap3x.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（savoy cup 2024 上海team 晓东 舞龙满场飞奔）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTa5kvb9qP65qw9Yc6Xj_gNactM.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（savoy cup 2024 上海team Lili 上演空中飞人）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7Uq2WqPoBvVB7NFw6hWM_MTHuV.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（savoy cup 2024 上海team 锤姐 滑入梦想的天梯）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjo8JVxWtqBLPPa8XSGV3q6hRewJ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（savoy cup 2024 上海team 红绸飒满全场）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlL6T6D5oBNpmwiION7SZ4FCRrGw.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（感谢@西游 现场摄影与积极互动，还有她的随堂笔记）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrMdlFkvuR6DyiNJIhWAsxAHOrur.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>最后用国际柴的金句结个尾：</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>没有训练的时候，身体是受惯性所妥协的。惯性限制了你的自由，打开身体惯性，追求不被身体妥协的自由。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>（好希望能听到国际柴能用国际通用语说下这段话 ......）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期 ｜ JAZZ</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头 ｜ Chinatown My Chinatown</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾 ｜ When I Get Low , I Get Hight</span></p>]]></description>
