  <item>
    <title>让小学生遇见了摇摆舞——shim sham（谢谢）Xiu</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64422f44a79cc81470165dc1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64422f44a79cc81470165dc1</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Apr 2023 06:37:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>时间轴 &nbsp;｜ &nbsp;预告</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;出发舞会，立下flag采访新舞者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;遇上会跳苗舞的苗族司机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;蹦完野迪跳shim sham</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;与Xiu共舞开启chat</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="652">10:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;孩子们学习shim sham期待六一上台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;反问主播时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;在一首slow dance中谈起跳舞的瓶颈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;精选片尾曲</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>知识点 &nbsp;｜ &nbsp;什么是shim sham ?</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>shim sham是一段经典的编舞，她是踢踏舞的赞美诗，摇摆舞的国际歌。每一场摇摆舞会中，当shim sham的音乐响起时，所有人都会不约而同地聚集到一起尽情狂欢。所以shim sham是摇摆舞派对中不可或缺的一场仪式。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>本集嘉宾 &nbsp;&nbsp;｜ &nbsp;&nbsp;Xiu</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Xiu是一名小学教师，她巧妙地结合校园社团文化将shim sham带进了校园，让她的学生们遇见了摇摆舞，体会到了这种舞蹈带来的快乐。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkj1QFmh2ipqYBW8WdPfeIuD_nDN.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>BGM &nbsp;｜ &nbsp;JAZZ</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《T’aint What You Do》—jimmie Lunceford</span></p><span></span><p><span>《A Different Kind Of Love》—Anthony Lazaro</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>舞会地点 &nbsp;&nbsp;| &nbsp;&nbsp;SSS认真摇摆@In Tango 工作室</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FioFRYTl0oiXX3Zb3Fi5eQbUD--I.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>（最右边蹲地的神兽原来是头社牛）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>Z视介听菠萝｜小宇宙｜喜马拉雅｜网易云音乐 ｜ 播客全网同名同步更新</span></em></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
